config BR2_PACKAGE_SGSNPU_MODELS
	bool "sgsnpu-models"
	default n
	help
	  YOLOv8n object detector compiled for the NPU ("IPU") of SigmaStar's
	  infinity6c (SSC377x/SSC378x), for majestic's object detection. Eight
	  classes: person, bicycle, car, motorcycle, bus, truck, cat and dog
	  (majestic reports them as human, vehicle and animal), and the
	  licence-plate models majestic reads plates with (lpr.enabled):
	  three IPU networks and their decoder. 2.6 MB in a squashfs for the
	  detector, 2.9 MB for the plates. AGPL-3.0.

	  https://github.com/OpenIPC/sgsnpu-models
